// Cat 10: identifier starting with digit — must fail
// '200foo' — lexer scans 200 then checks for glued alpha: fires LexerError
// Note: error message may be misleading ("Missing separator between number and unit")
// even though 'foo' is not a unit keyword
recipe test() serves 1 {
    ingredient 200foo : 200 g
    step "x" { combine(200foo) }
}
evaluate test()
